name: the data windows inside a recorded session: /play 1, then in sector 4505 the PDA's character page (Skills, Faction), missions, equipment, cargo and the item details of a right-click, then /stop
# The replay's home sector has an empty skill list, unnamed faction bars and bare missions / equipment; the
# recording (ea/alex3, Heidl, 2004-04-14) has the real ones. Retail is the reference (2026-11-14, P3): Heidl
# level 147 Terran Tradesman, skills Beam Weapon / Befriend / Build Components / Build Devices, 'You are affiliated
# with: InfinitiCorp Traders' over named bars, three missions, the ship's stats and equipment, cargo items, and a
# right-click on an item opens its details (an equipped shield: 'No 1 Most Amazing Shield Model Z'; the first
# cargo slot: 'Arduinne Security Pass'), closed with its page. The windows open no file and send no packet; the
# equipment and cargo pages write player<ID>_options.ini when they close.
# Session 2's loading takes 6 to 25 s on retail: the world is waited on by the first 'Render: Frame Rate' line
# after a mouse move (event steps look at the lines since the last input step: the home sector's own frame lines
# come before it). The windows part takes about 15 s of the playback's recorded pace.
# Ours shows the same since 2026-11-14 (the ability table's reader in kv_util.cpp; ui_item_examination.cpp calling
# the real inventory and property-builder classes). The details window opens no file of its own, so on our build
# the check was that its two former stand-ins are not hit; the one client build has no stand-in (2026-11-21),
# so on both it is the shots.
timeout: 400
include _login
key 0x08
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x8'
alive 1
text '/play 1'
key 0x0D
expect-event antprox 'command "/play 1"' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF' within 20
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: playback of 1, sector session 2 of 2' within 60
move 640,600
wait-event msg 'Render: Frame Rate' within 90
wait-quiet proxy 2 within 60
shot w_entered
# Y: [Character], its Skills tab, then its Faction tab
key 0x59
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x59'
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
click gadget pda.char.skills
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed mouse 0x202 at 70, 258'
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
shot w_skills
click gadget pda.char.faction
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed mouse 0x202 at 261, 258'
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
shot w_faction
key 0x59
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
# U: [Missions]
key 0x55
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x55'
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
shot w_missions
key 0x55
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
# I: [Equipment], the details of the equipped shield, closed with the page
key 0x49
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x49'
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
shot w_equipment
rclick gadget equip.shield
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed mouse 0x205 at 480, 788'
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
shot w_equip_details
key 0x49
expect-event proxy 'player\d+_options\.ini", W'
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
# O: [Cargo], the details of the first slot's item, closed with the window
key 0x4F
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x4F'
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
shot w_cargo
rclick gadget cargo.slot0
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed mouse 0x205 at 56, 442'
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
shot w_cargo_details
key 0x4F
expect-event proxy 'player\d+_options\.ini", W'
wait-quiet proxy 0.7 within 15
shot w_closed
key 0x08
alive 1
text '/stop'
key 0x0D
expect-event antprox 'command "/stop"' within 10
wait-event antprox 'playback of 1 stopped \(/stop\)' within 10
wait-event antprox 'sent SERVER_HANDOFF.*back to' within 10
wait-event antprox 'Sector connection #[0-9]+: received START_ACK' within 120
wait-quiet proxy 2 within 60
alive 4
shot w_stopped
